  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "明天李总那边有个项目要谈，你俩跟我一起去什么项目啊？王姐，一千万这么大，这个项目李总很重视，你俩跟着我说话，做事都注意点，没问题。王姐，放心吧，王姐肯定不给你丢脸。李总久仰，久仰，王总客气了。关于这个季度的市场占有率，你们这边有什么具体的措施吗？我们做了充分的调研。根据目前的增长趋势，我们的核心竞争主要体现在三个方面。小张啊，你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来了的人，真是后生可畏啊，哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，我就是个打辅助的合同，今天先不着急签，李总还有什么问题吗？没什么这么大的项目，我再考虑考虑。李总，这正好明天晚上，我组了个局陈，总也会过来。王姐要是有时间一起吃个饭，李总邀请，那肯定有时间。行，那项目的事儿，咱们明天再聊。王姐，刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？合同都准备签了，李总怎么突然说要考虑你自己想想，刚才说什么了，我也没说什么啊。李总夸我，我就是谦虚了一下，总不能人家夸我两句，我还真认了吧。李总夸你是认可你的能力，结果你倒好，自己先告诉人家，你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题啊。一千万的项目你自己都不敢认自己的能力，你让客户怎么放心？就因为这一句话，很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，也看你会不会跟人打交道。那这个项目是不是没戏了？还有机会，这个项目光提成都不止一百万。李总既然没有直接拒绝，还主动约了明天的贩案局，就说明事情还有转机，能不能把这个项目拿下来，就看你们两个明天的表现了。有王杰来了，快坐快坐。不好意思，让两位久等了。哪里哪里都是自己人。小张啊，今天高兴，刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。好好，那祝大家吃好喝。好，我先干了啊。好好，王姐，那我也借这个机会说两句。好，你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，也感谢王姐带我们过来，让我先认识各位前辈，我叫玲玲。俗话说，相聚是一种缘分。此时此刻，我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，祝各位扶摇直上。九万里事业长虹节节高。哈哈哈。好，这姑娘会说话，王姐，来这杯，我敬你陈总这杯，我替王姐敬您，我敬的是你们领导，你是领导吗？瞧您说的，您敬的是我领导，我同样敬的也领导，您敬领导是心意，我敬您是尊敬这杯，我敬的是生意，咱们随意，祝您生意一路长虹，万事顺利。这小姑娘会说话，琳琳刚才说的不错，来咱俩喝一个，谢谢李总。哎，怎么到我这就剩半杯了，瓶底酒，这叫发财酒，到底发财好事，再来好一个发财酒。琳琳，你这姑娘反应挺快，王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。李总，您过奖了，主要还是王姐平时带的好强将手下无若兵，我总不能给我们王姐丢脸呀。哈哈哈嗯，王姐，你手底下这个姑娘不错，年轻人还得多跟您学习。哎，王姐李总，您说昨天那个一千万的项目，我考虑好了，项目可以继续合作。不过我有个条件，李总，您说这个项目后面我希望让玲玲来负责。李总，我对小张的业务能力没问题，这一点昨天我就看出来了。不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目交给琳琳，我更放心，谢谢李总信任，也谢谢王姐给我这个机会。后面有什么做的不到位的地方，还得请两位多指点。好，那就这么定了。琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，后面这个项目你来负责，谢谢王姐，我一定把它做好，有不懂的地方随时问我，嗯，王姐怎么了？这个项目前两天明明是我谈下来的，李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的，为什么最后负责人却变成琳琳了？你真不知道为什么业务上你不比玲玲差，甚至前两天谈项目的时候，你表现的很好，可为什么都已经准备签合同了，李总突然又不签了。再想想昨天晚上的饭局，我突然让你讲两句，你说了什么？大家吃好喝。好，我先干了。陈总问玲玲，你是领导吗？如果换成你，你知道怎么接吗？陈总杯子里只倒了半杯酒。如果是你，你第一反应是什么？可能先跟陈总道歉，这就是区别。你不是能力不行，是这么大的项目，除了把事情做好，还要面对客户、合作方，还有各种突发情况。李总最后选琳琳，不是因为她比你会说几句漂亮话，是因为昨天晚上他都在看你们两个人遇到事情的时候怎么处理，别光想着自己为什么没拿到，好好想想琳琳为什么能拿到练练。刚才我确实有点不服，嗯，毕竟这个项目签了那些业务问题，也是我回答的。但是王姐刚才说完，我仔细想了想，我好像明白李总为什么最后选你了，为什么？哎，业务上的问题我会回答，可一碰到这种突发情况，我就嘴笨，反应慢。但有件事我还是没想明白什么。李总夸我的时候，我把功劳给了王姐。后来李总夸你的时候，你也把功劳给了王姐。可我说完，人家合同都不想签了，你说完人家反而越来越认可你。因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，你可以抬高别人，但是没必要把自己压下去。什么意思？比如那天李总夸你，后生可畏，你完全可以说您过奖了。要不是您愿意给机会，我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，以后还得跟您多学呢。这样既没有把功劳全揽到自己身上，也没有把自己说的一文不值。可是还有个问题，昨天陈总突然问你，你是领导吗？还有倒酒突然只剩半杯，这些又没人提前告诉你，你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接。你别告诉我这些全都是林常想的。当然不是，那你到底是怎么练的？其实我以前跟你一样，不爱说话，不爱争辩，一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。它里面就是一个场景，一个场景的告诉你，遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。比如别人夸你优秀，你可以回，那是不优秀点儿，怎么能和你做朋友呢？当别人说你真聪明，你就回近朱者赤，和你在一起啊，熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，你就回领导，这都是我应该做的。强将手下吴若冰，我怎么能给您丢脸呢？难怪你每次都能借的这么快，这种东西不是天生的，就是平时一个场景，一个场景的，看一个场景，一个场景的练。每天看两页，慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，应该怎么说？这里面还有很多生活里的场景，比如对象给你发红包，你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣，同事向你借钱，你又不想借，可以回，大家都是一样的年纪，你没有的，我能有吗？还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，你可以回随便想，千万别跟我客气，目前不收费，这个有意思。我第一次读到这些的时候，真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，一个一个拆开给你看，别人怎么说，你可以怎么接，都是一句一句给你举例。所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，每天不用看很多看两页，碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，你就知道怎么接了。这本先借，我看看拿去吧，回去慢慢看。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00001",
      "start_ms": 620,
      "end_ms": 2400,
      "text": "明天李总那边有个项目要谈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2400,
      "end_ms": 4300,
      "text": "你俩跟我一起去什么项目啊？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4300,
      "end_ms": 4680,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00004",
      "start_ms": 6440,
      "end_ms": 9820,
      "text": "一千万这么大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10040,
      "end_ms": 11620,
      "text": "这个项目李总很重视，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00006",
      "start_ms": 11940,
      "end_ms": 13300,
      "text": "你俩跟着我说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13300,
      "end_ms": 14540,
      "text": "做事都注意点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00008",
      "start_ms": 14840,
      "end_ms": 15320,
      "text": "没问题。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00009",
      "start_ms": 15320,
      "end_ms": 15720,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00010",
      "start_ms": 15980,
      "end_ms": 16400,
      "text": "放心吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00011",
      "start_ms": 16400,
      "end_ms": 17705,
      "text": "王姐肯定不给你丢脸。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00012",
      "start_ms": 20680,
      "end_ms": 21420,
      "text": "李总久仰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00013",
      "start_ms": 21420,
      "end_ms": 21700,
      "text": "久仰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00014",
      "start_ms": 21700,
      "end_ms": 22300,
      "text": "王总客气了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00015",
      "start_ms": 22300,
      "end_ms": 23900,
      "text": "关于这个季度的市场占有率，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00016",
      "start_ms": 23920,
      "end_ms": 25440,
      "text": "你们这边有什么具体的措施吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00017",
      "start_ms": 25460,
      "end_ms": 26580,
      "text": "我们做了充分的调研。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00018",
      "start_ms": 26760,
      "end_ms": 27880,
      "text": "根据目前的增长趋势，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00019",
      "start_ms": 27900,
      "end_ms": 29955,
      "text": "我们的核心竞争主要体现在三个方面。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00020",
      "start_ms": 32740,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00021",
      "start_ms": 33940,
      "end_ms": 36980,
      "text": "你是第一个十来分钟就能把项目谈下来了的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00022",
      "start_ms": 37400,
      "end_ms": 38820,
      "text": "真是后生可畏啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00023",
      "start_ms": 39220,
      "end_ms": 41440,
      "text": "哪里哪里还是我们王姐厉害，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00024",
      "start_ms": 41680,
      "end_ms": 47090,
      "text": "我就是个打辅助的合同，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00025",
      "start_ms": 47090,
      "end_ms": 48150,
      "text": "今天先不着急签，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00026",
      "start_ms": 48670,
      "end_ms": 50310,
      "text": "李总还有什么问题吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00027",
      "start_ms": 50550,
      "end_ms": 52390,
      "text": "没什么这么大的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00028",
      "start_ms": 52610,
      "end_ms": 53710,
      "text": "我再考虑考虑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00029",
      "start_ms": 54010,
      "end_ms": 54409,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00030",
      "start_ms": 54409,
      "end_ms": 56150,
      "text": "这正好明天晚上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00031",
      "start_ms": 56150,
      "end_ms": 57470,
      "text": "我组了个局陈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00032",
      "start_ms": 57470,
      "end_ms": 58290,
      "text": "总也会过来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00033",
      "start_ms": 58450,
      "end_ms": 60215,
      "text": "王姐要是有时间一起吃个饭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00034",
      "start_ms": 60870,
      "end_ms": 61650,
      "text": "李总邀请，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00035",
      "start_ms": 61730,
      "end_ms": 62835,
      "text": "那肯定有时间。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00036",
      "start_ms": 63200,
      "end_ms": 63565,
      "text": "行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00037",
      "start_ms": 65190,
      "end_ms": 66050,
      "text": "那项目的事儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00038",
      "start_ms": 66050,
      "end_ms": 66815,
      "text": "咱们明天再聊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00039",
      "start_ms": 72590,
      "end_ms": 73005,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00040",
      "start_ms": 75480,
      "end_ms": 77295,
      "text": "刚才项目不是都已经谈好了吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00041",
      "start_ms": 77630,
      "end_ms": 78805,
      "text": "合同都准备签了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00042",
      "start_ms": 79250,
      "end_ms": 83080,
      "text": "李总怎么突然说要考虑你自己想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00043",
      "start_ms": 83080,
      "end_ms": 84060,
      "text": "刚才说什么了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00044",
      "start_ms": 84140,
      "end_ms": 85205,
      "text": "我也没说什么啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00045",
      "start_ms": 85660,
      "end_ms": 86340,
      "text": "李总夸我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00046",
      "start_ms": 86340,
      "end_ms": 87475,
      "text": "我就是谦虚了一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00047",
      "start_ms": 87910,
      "end_ms": 89030,
      "text": "总不能人家夸我两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00048",
      "start_ms": 89030,
      "end_ms": 90025,
      "text": "我还真认了吧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00049",
      "start_ms": 90540,
      "end_ms": 93045,
      "text": "李总夸你是认可你的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00050",
      "start_ms": 93390,
      "end_ms": 94295,
      "text": "结果你倒好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00051",
      "start_ms": 94720,
      "end_ms": 95835,
      "text": "自己先告诉人家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00052",
      "start_ms": 96120,
      "end_ms": 99220,
      "text": "你就是个打辅助的这句话有什么问题啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00053",
      "start_ms": 99220,
      "end_ms": 102305,
      "text": "一千万的项目你自己都不敢认自己的能力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00054",
      "start_ms": 102510,
      "end_ms": 103595,
      "text": "你让客户怎么放心？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00055",
      "start_ms": 104090,
      "end_ms": 105185,
      "text": "就因为这一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00056",
      "start_ms": 105580,
      "end_ms": 108745,
      "text": "很多时候人家看的不只是你会不会做事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00057",
      "start_ms": 109090,
      "end_ms": 110955,
      "text": "也看你会不会跟人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00058",
      "start_ms": 112510,
      "end_ms": 114155,
      "text": "那这个项目是不是没戏了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00059",
      "start_ms": 114440,
      "end_ms": 115145,
      "text": "还有机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00060",
      "start_ms": 115760,
      "end_ms": 117765,
      "text": "这个项目光提成都不止一百万。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00061",
      "start_ms": 118260,
      "end_ms": 119805,
      "text": "李总既然没有直接拒绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00062",
      "start_ms": 120270,
      "end_ms": 121510,
      "text": "还主动约了明天的贩案局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00063",
      "start_ms": 121510,
      "end_ms": 122745,
      "text": "就说明事情还有转机，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00064",
      "start_ms": 123260,
      "end_ms": 124725,
      "text": "能不能把这个项目拿下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00065",
      "start_ms": 125530,
      "end_ms": 126935,
      "text": "就看你们两个明天的表现了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00066",
      "start_ms": 131730,
      "end_ms": 133410,
      "text": "有王杰来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00067",
      "start_ms": 133610,
      "end_ms": 134415,
      "text": "快坐快坐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00068",
      "start_ms": 135140,
      "end_ms": 135835,
      "text": "不好意思，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00069",
      "start_ms": 136210,
      "end_ms": 137390,
      "text": "让两位久等了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00070",
      "start_ms": 137450,
      "end_ms": 139145,
      "text": "哪里哪里都是自己人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00071",
      "start_ms": 146220,
      "end_ms": 146835,
      "text": "小张啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00072",
      "start_ms": 147230,
      "end_ms": 147890,
      "text": "今天高兴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00073",
      "start_ms": 148070,
      "end_ms": 150250,
      "text": "刚好李总和陈总都在你来讲两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00074",
      "start_ms": 150250,
      "end_ms": 150670,
      "text": "好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00075",
      "start_ms": 150850,
      "end_ms": 152270,
      "text": "那祝大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00076",
      "start_ms": 152270,
      "end_ms": 152510,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00077",
      "start_ms": 152590,
      "end_ms": 154775,
      "text": "我先干了啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00078",
      "start_ms": 154930,
      "end_ms": 155330,
      "text": "好好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00079",
      "start_ms": 157760,
      "end_ms": 158265,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00080",
      "start_ms": 158590,
      "end_ms": 159975,
      "text": "那我也借这个机会说两句。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00081",
      "start_ms": 160190,
      "end_ms": 160430,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00082",
      "start_ms": 160470,
      "end_ms": 162785,
      "text": "你说非常感谢李总今天组的局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00083",
      "start_ms": 163040,
      "end_ms": 164340,
      "text": "也感谢王姐带我们过来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00084",
      "start_ms": 164340,
      "end_ms": 165655,
      "text": "让我先认识各位前辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00085",
      "start_ms": 165960,
      "end_ms": 166540,
      "text": "我叫玲玲。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00086",
      "start_ms": 166820,
      "end_ms": 167420,
      "text": "俗话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00087",
      "start_ms": 167600,
      "end_ms": 169055,
      "text": "相聚是一种缘分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00088",
      "start_ms": 169380,
      "end_ms": 169900,
      "text": "此时此刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00089",
      "start_ms": 169900,
      "end_ms": 172025,
      "text": "我把对各位的祝福化作一杯美酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00090",
      "start_ms": 172280,
      "end_ms": 173700,
      "text": "祝各位扶摇直上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00091",
      "start_ms": 173700,
      "end_ms": 175915,
      "text": "九万里事业长虹节节高。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00092",
      "start_ms": 176480,
      "end_ms": 177020,
      "text": "哈哈哈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00093",
      "start_ms": 177220,
      "end_ms": 177635,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00094",
      "start_ms": 178260,
      "end_ms": 179385,
      "text": "这姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00095",
      "start_ms": 186790,
      "end_ms": 187230,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00096",
      "start_ms": 187690,
      "end_ms": 188270,
      "text": "来这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00097",
      "start_ms": 188270,
      "end_ms": 191970,
      "text": "我敬你陈总这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00098",
      "start_ms": 191970,
      "end_ms": 192850,
      "text": "我替王姐敬您，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00099",
      "start_ms": 193770,
      "end_ms": 195130,
      "text": "我敬的是你们领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00100",
      "start_ms": 195870,
      "end_ms": 196690,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00101",
      "start_ms": 197170,
      "end_ms": 198070,
      "text": "瞧您说的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00102",
      "start_ms": 198390,
      "end_ms": 199490,
      "text": "您敬的是我领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00103",
      "start_ms": 199650,
      "end_ms": 200870,
      "text": "我同样敬的也领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00104",
      "start_ms": 201090,
      "end_ms": 202310,
      "text": "您敬领导是心意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00105",
      "start_ms": 202450,
      "end_ms": 204330,
      "text": "我敬您是尊敬这杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00106",
      "start_ms": 204330,
      "end_ms": 205170,
      "text": "我敬的是生意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00107",
      "start_ms": 205250,
      "end_ms": 205790,
      "text": "咱们随意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00108",
      "start_ms": 205790,
      "end_ms": 207210,
      "text": "祝您生意一路长虹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00109",
      "start_ms": 207310,
      "end_ms": 207990,
      "text": "万事顺利。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00110",
      "start_ms": 210670,
      "end_ms": 211930,
      "text": "这小姑娘会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00111",
      "start_ms": 212150,
      "end_ms": 213670,
      "text": "琳琳刚才说的不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00112",
      "start_ms": 213750,
      "end_ms": 214750,
      "text": "来咱俩喝一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00113",
      "start_ms": 214750,
      "end_ms": 215465,
      "text": "谢谢李总。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00114",
      "start_ms": 218070,
      "end_ms": 218310,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00115",
      "start_ms": 218850,
      "end_ms": 220410,
      "text": "怎么到我这就剩半杯了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00116",
      "start_ms": 220930,
      "end_ms": 221670,
      "text": "瓶底酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00117",
      "start_ms": 221750,
      "end_ms": 222690,
      "text": "这叫发财酒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00118",
      "start_ms": 222930,
      "end_ms": 224310,
      "text": "到底发财好事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00119",
      "start_ms": 224310,
      "end_ms": 227110,
      "text": "再来好一个发财酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00120",
      "start_ms": 227290,
      "end_ms": 227710,
      "text": "琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00121",
      "start_ms": 228310,
      "end_ms": 229810,
      "text": "你这姑娘反应挺快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00122",
      "start_ms": 230470,
      "end_ms": 233870,
      "text": "王姐手底下有你这样的员工省心啊。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00123",
      "start_ms": 234650,
      "end_ms": 235130,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00124",
      "start_ms": 235250,
      "end_ms": 236030,
      "text": "您过奖了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00125",
      "start_ms": 236410,
      "end_ms": 239970,
      "text": "主要还是王姐平时带的好强将手下无若兵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00126",
      "start_ms": 240250,
      "end_ms": 242215,
      "text": "我总不能给我们王姐丢脸呀。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00127",
      "start_ms": 242750,
      "end_ms": 244020,
      "text": "哈哈哈嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00128",
      "start_ms": 244070,
      "end_ms": 244515,
      "text": "王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00129",
      "start_ms": 245040,
      "end_ms": 246815,
      "text": "你手底下这个姑娘不错，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00130",
      "start_ms": 247760,
      "end_ms": 250165,
      "text": "年轻人还得多跟您学习。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00131",
      "start_ms": 250680,
      "end_ms": 251005,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00132",
      "start_ms": 252810,
      "end_ms": 253970,
      "text": "王姐李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00133",
      "start_ms": 254050,
      "end_ms": 256985,
      "text": "您说昨天那个一千万的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00134",
      "start_ms": 258530,
      "end_ms": 259325,
      "text": "我考虑好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00135",
      "start_ms": 260110,
      "end_ms": 261295,
      "text": "项目可以继续合作。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00136",
      "start_ms": 262220,
      "end_ms": 263065,
      "text": "不过我有个条件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00137",
      "start_ms": 264020,
      "end_ms": 264460,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00138",
      "start_ms": 264620,
      "end_ms": 267995,
      "text": "您说这个项目后面我希望让玲玲来负责。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00139",
      "start_ms": 269950,
      "end_ms": 270410,
      "text": "李总，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00140",
      "start_ms": 270530,
      "end_ms": 274125,
      "text": "我对小张的业务能力没问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00141",
      "start_ms": 274930,
      "end_ms": 276315,
      "text": "这一点昨天我就看出来了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00142",
      "start_ms": 276900,
      "end_ms": 280145,
      "text": "不过这么大的项目后面少不了跟各种人打交道。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00143",
      "start_ms": 280390,
      "end_ms": 284110,
      "text": "今天晚上我也一直在观察你们两个这个项目交给琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00144",
      "start_ms": 284110,
      "end_ms": 284805,
      "text": "我更放心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00145",
      "start_ms": 285980,
      "end_ms": 286925,
      "text": "谢谢李总信任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00146",
      "start_ms": 287430,
      "end_ms": 288905,
      "text": "也谢谢王姐给我这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00147",
      "start_ms": 289390,
      "end_ms": 290930,
      "text": "后面有什么做的不到位的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00148",
      "start_ms": 291090,
      "end_ms": 292135,
      "text": "还得请两位多指点。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00149",
      "start_ms": 292730,
      "end_ms": 293105,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00150",
      "start_ms": 294000,
      "end_ms": 294855,
      "text": "那就这么定了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00151",
      "start_ms": 300580,
      "end_ms": 303440,
      "text": "琳琳李总那边合同已经确定了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00152",
      "start_ms": 303740,
      "end_ms": 305480,
      "text": "后面这个项目你来负责，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00153",
      "start_ms": 306020,
      "end_ms": 306660,
      "text": "谢谢王姐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00154",
      "start_ms": 306700,
      "end_ms": 307420,
      "text": "我一定把它做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00155",
      "start_ms": 307420,
      "end_ms": 308800,
      "text": "有不懂的地方随时问我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00156",
      "start_ms": 308920,
      "end_ms": 309215,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00157",
      "start_ms": 312280,
      "end_ms": 314580,
      "text": "王姐怎么了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00158",
      "start_ms": 314840,
      "end_ms": 316920,
      "text": "这个项目前两天明明是我谈下来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00159",
      "start_ms": 317360,
      "end_ms": 319480,
      "text": "李总问的那些业务问题也是我回答的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00160",
      "start_ms": 319840,
      "end_ms": 321920,
      "text": "为什么最后负责人却变成琳琳了？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00161",
      "start_ms": 322400,
      "end_ms": 328440,
      "text": "你真不知道为什么业务上你不比玲玲差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00162",
      "start_ms": 328860,
      "end_ms": 330480,
      "text": "甚至前两天谈项目的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00163",
      "start_ms": 330480,
      "end_ms": 331440,
      "text": "你表现的很好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00164",
      "start_ms": 331820,
      "end_ms": 333840,
      "text": "可为什么都已经准备签合同了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00165",
      "start_ms": 333960,
      "end_ms": 335320,
      "text": "李总突然又不签了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00166",
      "start_ms": 336120,
      "end_ms": 337660,
      "text": "再想想昨天晚上的饭局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00167",
      "start_ms": 338260,
      "end_ms": 339580,
      "text": "我突然让你讲两句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00168",
      "start_ms": 339820,
      "end_ms": 340600,
      "text": "你说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00169",
      "start_ms": 340760,
      "end_ms": 341540,
      "text": "大家吃好喝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00170",
      "start_ms": 341540,
      "end_ms": 341780,
      "text": "好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00171",
      "start_ms": 341840,
      "end_ms": 342499,
      "text": "我先干了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00172",
      "start_ms": 342900,
      "end_ms": 343760,
      "text": "陈总问玲玲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00173",
      "start_ms": 343760,
      "end_ms": 344660,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00174",
      "start_ms": 344840,
      "end_ms": 345620,
      "text": "如果换成你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00175",
      "start_ms": 345620,
      "end_ms": 346640,
      "text": "你知道怎么接吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00176",
      "start_ms": 347540,
      "end_ms": 349140,
      "text": "陈总杯子里只倒了半杯酒。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00177",
      "start_ms": 349300,
      "end_ms": 349980,
      "text": "如果是你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00178",
      "start_ms": 350220,
      "end_ms": 351480,
      "text": "你第一反应是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00179",
      "start_ms": 352360,
      "end_ms": 354540,
      "text": "可能先跟陈总道歉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00180",
      "start_ms": 354740,
      "end_ms": 355500,
      "text": "这就是区别。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00181",
      "start_ms": 355760,
      "end_ms": 356890,
      "text": "你不是能力不行，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00182",
      "start_ms": 357150,
      "end_ms": 358190,
      "text": "是这么大的项目，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00183",
      "start_ms": 358210,
      "end_ms": 359210,
      "text": "除了把事情做好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00184",
      "start_ms": 359210,
      "end_ms": 360450,
      "text": "还要面对客户、合作方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00185",
      "start_ms": 360450,
      "end_ms": 361535,
      "text": "还有各种突发情况。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00186",
      "start_ms": 361910,
      "end_ms": 363010,
      "text": "李总最后选琳琳，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00187",
      "start_ms": 363090,
      "end_ms": 365005,
      "text": "不是因为她比你会说几句漂亮话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00188",
      "start_ms": 365350,
      "end_ms": 369165,
      "text": "是因为昨天晚上他都在看你们两个人遇到事情的时候怎么处理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00189",
      "start_ms": 370060,
      "end_ms": 371795,
      "text": "别光想着自己为什么没拿到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00190",
      "start_ms": 372220,
      "end_ms": 379980,
      "text": "好好想想琳琳为什么能拿到练练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00191",
      "start_ms": 380230,
      "end_ms": 381210,
      "text": "刚才我确实有点不服，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00192",
      "start_ms": 381270,
      "end_ms": 381595,
      "text": "嗯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00193",
      "start_ms": 382120,
      "end_ms": 383660,
      "text": "毕竟这个项目签了那些业务问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00194",
      "start_ms": 383660,
      "end_ms": 384505,
      "text": "也是我回答的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00195",
      "start_ms": 385070,
      "end_ms": 386090,
      "text": "但是王姐刚才说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00196",
      "start_ms": 386090,
      "end_ms": 386965,
      "text": "我仔细想了想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00197",
      "start_ms": 387370,
      "end_ms": 389565,
      "text": "我好像明白李总为什么最后选你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00198",
      "start_ms": 389800,
      "end_ms": 390425,
      "text": "为什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00199",
      "start_ms": 390840,
      "end_ms": 391215,
      "text": "哎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00200",
      "start_ms": 391730,
      "end_ms": 393155,
      "text": "业务上的问题我会回答，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00201",
      "start_ms": 393580,
      "end_ms": 394800,
      "text": "可一碰到这种突发情况，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00202",
      "start_ms": 394800,
      "end_ms": 395440,
      "text": "我就嘴笨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00203",
      "start_ms": 395620,
      "end_ms": 396215,
      "text": "反应慢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00204",
      "start_ms": 397080,
      "end_ms": 399450,
      "text": "但有件事我还是没想明白什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00205",
      "start_ms": 399590,
      "end_ms": 400650,
      "text": "李总夸我的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00206",
      "start_ms": 400650,
      "end_ms": 401650,
      "text": "我把功劳给了王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00207",
      "start_ms": 401770,
      "end_ms": 402950,
      "text": "后来李总夸你的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00208",
      "start_ms": 402950,
      "end_ms": 404095,
      "text": "你也把功劳给了王姐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00209",
      "start_ms": 404310,
      "end_ms": 404950,
      "text": "可我说完，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00210",
      "start_ms": 405010,
      "end_ms": 406310,
      "text": "人家合同都不想签了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00211",
      "start_ms": 406350,
      "end_ms": 408305,
      "text": "你说完人家反而越来越认可你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00212",
      "start_ms": 408860,
      "end_ms": 411245,
      "text": "因为谦虚不等于否定自己啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00213",
      "start_ms": 411680,
      "end_ms": 412780,
      "text": "你可以抬高别人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00214",
      "start_ms": 412920,
      "end_ms": 414385,
      "text": "但是没必要把自己压下去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00215",
      "start_ms": 414610,
      "end_ms": 415155,
      "text": "什么意思？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00216",
      "start_ms": 415410,
      "end_ms": 416690,
      "text": "比如那天李总夸你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00217",
      "start_ms": 416690,
      "end_ms": 417515,
      "text": "后生可畏，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00218",
      "start_ms": 417850,
      "end_ms": 419610,
      "text": "你完全可以说您过奖了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00219",
      "start_ms": 419770,
      "end_ms": 421215,
      "text": "要不是您愿意给机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00220",
      "start_ms": 421510,
      "end_ms": 423430,
      "text": "我哪能跟您这么有魄力的人合作啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00221",
      "start_ms": 423510,
      "end_ms": 425025,
      "text": "以后还得跟您多学呢。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00222",
      "start_ms": 425420,
      "end_ms": 427680,
      "text": "这样既没有把功劳全揽到自己身上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00223",
      "start_ms": 427820,
      "end_ms": 429545,
      "text": "也没有把自己说的一文不值。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00224",
      "start_ms": 429990,
      "end_ms": 430905,
      "text": "可是还有个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00225",
      "start_ms": 431540,
      "end_ms": 432745,
      "text": "昨天陈总突然问你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00226",
      "start_ms": 433100,
      "end_ms": 433935,
      "text": "你是领导吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00227",
      "start_ms": 434270,
      "end_ms": 435745,
      "text": "还有倒酒突然只剩半杯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00228",
      "start_ms": 436440,
      "end_ms": 438025,
      "text": "这些又没人提前告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00229",
      "start_ms": 438710,
      "end_ms": 440675,
      "text": "你为什么每次马上就知道怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00230",
      "start_ms": 441550,
      "end_ms": 443535,
      "text": "你别告诉我这些全都是林常想的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00231",
      "start_ms": 443920,
      "end_ms": 444685,
      "text": "当然不是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00232",
      "start_ms": 445280,
      "end_ms": 446535,
      "text": "那你到底是怎么练的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00233",
      "start_ms": 447350,
      "end_ms": 448765,
      "text": "其实我以前跟你一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00234",
      "start_ms": 449440,
      "end_ms": 450200,
      "text": "不爱说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00235",
      "start_ms": 450260,
      "end_ms": 451085,
      "text": "不爱争辩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00236",
      "start_ms": 451870,
      "end_ms": 454495,
      "text": "一到这种场合就不知道应该说什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00237",
      "start_ms": 455440,
      "end_ms": 458380,
      "text": "后来我就经常看这本把话说的恰到好处。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00238",
      "start_ms": 458720,
      "end_ms": 460180,
      "text": "它里面就是一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00239",
      "start_ms": 460180,
      "end_ms": 461420,
      "text": "一个场景的告诉你，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00240",
      "start_ms": 461580,
      "end_ms": 463795,
      "text": "遇到不同的人不同的话应该怎么接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00241",
      "start_ms": 464800,
      "end_ms": 466700,
      "text": "比如别人夸你优秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00242",
      "start_ms": 466840,
      "end_ms": 467605,
      "text": "你可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00243",
      "start_ms": 468080,
      "end_ms": 469260,
      "text": "那是不优秀点儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00244",
      "start_ms": 469260,
      "end_ms": 470585,
      "text": "怎么能和你做朋友呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00245",
      "start_ms": 470860,
      "end_ms": 472020,
      "text": "当别人说你真聪明，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00246",
      "start_ms": 472160,
      "end_ms": 473680,
      "text": "你就回近朱者赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00247",
      "start_ms": 473820,
      "end_ms": 474740,
      "text": "和你在一起啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00248",
      "start_ms": 474740,
      "end_ms": 477570,
      "text": "熏都熏出来了当领导跟你说辛苦了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00249",
      "start_ms": 477750,
      "end_ms": 479100,
      "text": "你就回领导，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00250",
      "start_ms": 479240,
      "end_ms": 480445,
      "text": "这都是我应该做的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00251",
      "start_ms": 480750,
      "end_ms": 482090,
      "text": "强将手下吴若冰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00252",
      "start_ms": 482230,
      "end_ms": 483635,
      "text": "我怎么能给您丢脸呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00253",
      "start_ms": 483890,
      "end_ms": 485485,
      "text": "难怪你每次都能借的这么快，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00254",
      "start_ms": 485900,
      "end_ms": 487475,
      "text": "这种东西不是天生的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00255",
      "start_ms": 488210,
      "end_ms": 489390,
      "text": "就是平时一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00256",
      "start_ms": 489390,
      "end_ms": 489950,
      "text": "一个场景的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00257",
      "start_ms": 489950,
      "end_ms": 490910,
      "text": "看一个场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00258",
      "start_ms": 490910,
      "end_ms": 491675,
      "text": "一个场景的练。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00259",
      "start_ms": 492450,
      "end_ms": 493375,
      "text": "每天看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00260",
      "start_ms": 493840,
      "end_ms": 495800,
      "text": "慢慢积累一些不同的场景之下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00261",
      "start_ms": 495800,
      "end_ms": 496500,
      "text": "应该怎么说？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00262",
      "start_ms": 496840,
      "end_ms": 498695,
      "text": "这里面还有很多生活里的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00263",
      "start_ms": 499000,
      "end_ms": 500100,
      "text": "比如对象给你发红包，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00264",
      "start_ms": 500100,
      "end_ms": 502935,
      "text": "你可以回你是我致富道路上最大的功臣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00265",
      "start_ms": 503360,
      "end_ms": 504320,
      "text": "同事向你借钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00266",
      "start_ms": 504500,
      "end_ms": 505200,
      "text": "你又不想借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00267",
      "start_ms": 505280,
      "end_ms": 505700,
      "text": "可以回，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00268",
      "start_ms": 505940,
      "end_ms": 507220,
      "text": "大家都是一样的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00269",
      "start_ms": 507360,
      "end_ms": 508020,
      "text": "你没有的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00270",
      "start_ms": 508020,
      "end_ms": 508845,
      "text": "我能有吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00271",
      "start_ms": 510000,
      "end_ms": 512065,
      "text": "还有心仪的人跟你说我想你了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00272",
      "start_ms": 512370,
      "end_ms": 514010,
      "text": "你可以回随便想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00273",
      "start_ms": 514210,
      "end_ms": 515405,
      "text": "千万别跟我客气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00274",
      "start_ms": 515620,
      "end_ms": 516305,
      "text": "目前不收费，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00275",
      "start_ms": 517870,
      "end_ms": 518770,
      "text": "这个有意思。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00276",
      "start_ms": 518850,
      "end_ms": 520170,
      "text": "我第一次读到这些的时候，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00277",
      "start_ms": 520170,
      "end_ms": 521765,
      "text": "真的有种豁然开朗的感觉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00278",
      "start_ms": 522340,
      "end_ms": 525880,
      "text": "这本书就是把工作、生活、人际交往里经常遇到的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00279",
      "start_ms": 525940,
      "end_ms": 527180,
      "text": "一个一个拆开给你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00280",
      "start_ms": 527460,
      "end_ms": 528220,
      "text": "别人怎么说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00281",
      "start_ms": 528360,
      "end_ms": 529140,
      "text": "你可以怎么接，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00282",
      "start_ms": 529280,
      "end_ms": 530755,
      "text": "都是一句一句给你举例。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00283",
      "start_ms": 531200,
      "end_ms": 533405,
      "text": "所以你平时就是这么练的对啊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00284",
      "start_ms": 533850,
      "end_ms": 535695,
      "text": "每天不用看很多看两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00285",
      "start_ms": 536060,
      "end_ms": 539370,
      "text": "碰到自己觉得有用的表达就记一记慢慢积累的多了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00286",
      "start_ms": 539570,
      "end_ms": 541730,
      "text": "工作和生活里再碰到类似的场景，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00287",
      "start_ms": 541790,
      "end_ms": 542845,
      "text": "你就知道怎么接了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00288",
      "start_ms": 544650,
      "end_ms": 545230,
      "text": "这本先借，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00289",
      "start_ms": 545230,
      "end_ms": 546560,
      "text": "我看看拿去吧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_e6b3d7c4a64b59f4_s00290",
      "start_ms": 546740,
      "end_ms": 547565,
      "text": "回去慢慢看。"
    }
  ],
